# Model files and videos are data: git must never change their line endings or try to diff them.
# OpenVINO .xml and NCNN .param files ARE text, but they have to stay byte-for-byte what their authors
# published (models/README.md lists the original names and repos).
*.onnx              binary
*.bin               binary
*.engine            binary
*.pt                binary
*.avi               binary
*.mp4               binary
models/**/*.xml     binary
models/**/*.param   binary
